TITLE Equilibrium oxidation of pyrite in pure water with fixed PO2; allow goethite and gypsum
SOLUTION 1 Pure water initial pH 7
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0     0.1
    Goethite 0   0
    Gypsum   0   0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -totals Fe S(6) S(-2)
    -molalities Fe+2 Fe+3
END
